---
title: From finished work to the car leaving
---
flowchart TD
  QC["Job at Quality check<br/>or Ready for delivery"] --> Create["Owner / accountant:<br/>Create invoice"]
  Create --> Draft["Draft: approved estimate lines<br/>+ parts used, if the customer agreed"]
  Draft --> Issue["Issue invoice<br/>INV-0001, frozen"]
  Issue --> Pay{"Customer pays?"}
  Pay -->|"Full"| Paid["Paid<br/>advisor + owners notified"]
  Pay -->|"Part"| Part["Part paid<br/>balance on invoice,<br/>customer and dashboard"]
  Pay -->|"Not yet"| Unpaid["Unpaid"]
  Paid --> Deliver["Advisor: Deliver to customer"]
  Part --> Deliver
  Unpaid --> Deliver
  Deliver --> Done["Delivered"]

  Wrong{"Billed by mistake?"} -.-> Refund["Refund each payment<br/>(reason, owner / accountant)"]
  Refund -.-> Void["Void invoice (reason)<br/>kept on record"]
  Void -.-> Create
  Issue -.-> Wrong

  NoInv["No issued invoice"] -. "database refuses delivery<br/>(invoice_required)" .-> Deliver
  Live["Live invoice"] -. "database refuses cancelling the job<br/>(invoice_open)" .-> Cancel["Cancel job"]
